l},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-28T04:29:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T13:57:56Z","closed_at":"2026-10-02T08:05:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123900","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123900.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123900.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis fixes a gap in `animation_node_state_machine`. `_find_next()` only compared priorities among the transitions whose condition was already true, without checking whether they could actually switch right now. So if the best-priority transition used `SWITCH_MODE_AT_END`, the state machine kept waiting for the current animation to finish, even though other transition's condition was already true and could have switched immediately.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #109286\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTested the before and after situations:\r\n\r\n- New test fails without the fix and passes with it.\r\n- Reproduced the issue's exact scenario with a script, on 4.7.2 stable and on current master before the fix\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Use of AI\r\nUsed Claude (Anthropic's AI coding assistant, via Claude Code) to help on tests coverage. Given test skeletons, patterns and other examples, asked to finish writing them and search for gaps not covered that could be hiding broken paths. Also used to help on resuming parts of the code.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123900/reactions